O:England, 1983
N:Verse and chorus. Melody from the lead-vocal channel of a MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 40290, channel 2), checked against track 4109 (channel 3). The original key, C minor, already sits on C4 to F4, so it is not transposed. Chords from the bass channels (Cm Ab | Cm/G). Zero-length and 1/16-length glitch notes in the source are dropped; bar 6 (track 40290 has a stray zero-length F there) takes the F E D shape that both tracks have in bar 4, and bar 8 holds the E for the full beat that track 4109 has. The chorus is sung in thirds; the lower line is written.
